  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Come Sail Away<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Welcome to Come Sail Away, a modern coastal retreat that sleeps up to 13 guests, located just minutes from Rosemary Beach along Scenic Highway 30A. <br><br>The home is perfectly positioned for enjoying the best of the area. Guests can walk or bike to the beach through the pedestrian underpass, avoiding Highway 98 and making beach access safe and convenient. <br><br>You're also just a short walk (0.5 miles) from 30Avenue, an upscale destination known for excellent restaurants, cafés, and boutique shopping. <br><br><br><br>The Space <br><br><br><br>Inside, the home features bright coastal design, comfortable gathering spaces, and everything needed for a relaxing beach stay. <br><br>The open living area is perfect for spending time together after a day at the beach, while the fully equipped kitchen and dining area make it easy to cook meals or enjoy takeout from nearby restaurants. <br><br><br><br>Sleeping Arrangements (Sleeps Up To 13) <br><br>The home comfortably accommodates large families and groups with flexible sleeping spaces. <br><br><br><br>Primary Suite – Main Level <br><br>Private bedroom with comfortable bedding and ensuite bathroom. <br><br><br><br>Primary Suite – Upper Level <br><br>Spacious primary bedroom with ensuite bathroom. <br><br><br><br>Bunk Room 1 <br><br>Perfect for kids or teens, this room features bunk beds designed for group stays. <br><br><br><br>Bunk Room 2 <br><br>A second bunk room provides additional sleeping space, making the home ideal for larger families. <br><br><br><br>Upstairs Living Area <br><br>Includes a sleeper sofa for additional sleeping flexibility. <br><br><br><br>Sleeping Layout Summary <br><br>• Primary Suite (Main Level) <br><br>• Primary Suite (Upper Level) <br><br>• Bunk Room #1 <br><br>• Bunk Room #2 <br><br>• Sleeper Sofa (Upstairs loft Area) <br><br><br><br>Outdoor Space <br><br>Enjoy a private backyard designed for relaxing evenings after a day at the beach. <br><br>• Fenced backyard <br><br>• Fire pit for evening gatherings <br><br>• Outdoor seating area<br><br>• Grill<br><br>The fenced yard also makes the home great for guests traveling with pets. <br><br><br><br>Home allows one dog under 30 lbs with approval prior to booking.<br><br><br><br>Getting Around:<br><br>Location Highlights <br><br>• Rosemary Beach – less than 1 mile <br><br>• Inlet Beach public beach access – less than 1 mile <br><br>• 30Avenue fine dining & shopping – 0.5 miles <br><br>• Scenic bike paths and walking trails nearby <br><br>A golf cart is included, making it easy and fun to explore the surrounding area, ride to the beach, or visit nearby restaurants and shops.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Modern 30A Retreat | Walk/Bike to Beach | Golf Cart"
        }
      ],
