        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "We had a fantastic stay at this home! It was perfect for our two families, especially with teen boys who had plenty of space to spread out. The house was modern, very clean, and well-appointed with everything we needed. The two master suites were a great touch, making it comfortable for both sets of parents. While we wished it was a bit closer to the beach, the drive wasn’t bad at all. Overall, a wonderful stay, and we’d definitely return!",
